changes to: DIRECTORY, ButtonParams, ButtonParamsBody, PauseProc, AddVoiceProc, CancelProc, DictationMachine, AdjustSilences, ResumeFromEnd, ResumeFromSelection, PlayFromSelection, AddCharMark, DeleteCharMarks, PlayBackMenuProc
Polle Zellweger (PTZ) April 21, 1990 6:20:49 pm PDT
Allow copying text between voice viewers and text viewers.
changes to: TextInput
new: CopyTextViewerToTextMarker, CopyTextMarkerToTextViewer
Polle Zellweger (PTZ) December 3, 1990 4:58:42 pm PST
Port to PCedar: change machine-dependent types, restructure to compensate for lack of file events in PFS.
new: RegisterViewerInterests
